flowchart TD
S([Authenticated US-07 generation waiting for provider or validation]) --> C{Failure kind?}
C -- Timeout or unavailable --> T[Abort provider work at 30-second boundary]
T --> E[503 sanitized error with retryable true]
C -- Malformed candidates --> M[502 sanitized generation error]
C -- Declared allergen conflict --> A[422 sanitized batch rejection]
E --> U[Commit no accepted or partial recipes]
M --> U
A --> U
U --> P[Preserve inventory, preferences, shopping, favorites and history]
P --> D[Show clear error and retain prior displayed content]
D --> R{User retries?}
R -- Yes --> N[New US-07 request with current owned data]
R -- No --> F([Remain on usable current screen])
